# fabrik.env — KEY=VALUE per line (real environment variables win). Created by `fabrik init`.
#
# Where fabrik keeps its data: this directory (runs/, state/, sessionlog.db). Specs live in ./projects.
# Server
# FABRIK_HOST=127.0.0.1
# FABRIK_PORT=8321
# FABRIK_AUTH=local            # local users + roles (required when binding to a non-loopback address)
#
# Code hosting / agents / LLMs: configure under "Connections" in the UI, or here, e.g.
# GH_TOKEN=
# FABRIK_LLM_PROVIDER=
